# Busy Beaver Holdouts (`BusyBeaver`)

Formal Lean 4 specifications and kernel-verified behavioral proofs (`IsHalt`, `IsNotHalt`,
`IsClosedPatternSet`, `HasCollatzReduction`, `IsClosedStackPatternSet`,
`HasStackedCollatzReduction`, `HasStackReduction`, `HasOdometerReduction`,
`HasTransducerReduction`, `IsValidAcceleration`, `CollatzHalts`) for Busy Beaver holdout
Turing machines (`BB(6)` and `BB(3, 3)`), connected to `ConjectureMachines.Machine` via
`BusyBeaver.Bridge`.
